        <body>
            <div xml:id="toc">

                <pb facs="0009" n="V" xml:id="pgV"/>

                <head>Contents</head>
                <p>(<hi rendition="#small-caps">Note</hi>: For previously published correspondence
                    on relations between the United States and Japan in 1941, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1931-41v01">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, Volumes
                        I</ref> and <ref target="frus:frus1931-41v02">II</ref>. Documents printed in
                    those volumes have not been reprinted in the 1941 annual volumes.)</p>
                <list type="toc">
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pgIII">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Preface</hi>
                        </ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Southward Advance of Japanese Expansionist
                            Movement</hi>: <list>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg1">Chapter I: January–March, 1941</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg119">Chapter II: April–July 3, 1941</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg196">Chapter III: July 4–September 30, 1941</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg301">Chapter IV: October 1–December 31, 1941</ref>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg397">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Repatriation of American Citizens From the
                                Far East</hi>
                        </ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Undeclared War Between Japan and China</hi>: <list>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg454">Political and military developments</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg554">Decision to withdraw United States Marines and
                                    Naval forces from China; incomplete withdrawal before outbreak
                                    of war with Japan</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg590">Efforts by the United States to provide
                                    financial assistance and war material for China</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg773">Policy of the United States to relinquish by
                                    agreement extraterritorial rights in China</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg777">Japanese interference with American treaty
                                    rights and with equality of commercial opportunity in
                                    China</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg806">Efforts by the United States and other powers
                                    to protect Chinese customs and other revenues, pledged as
                                    security for loans, from Japanese encroachment</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg822">American interest in Japanese demands affecting
                                    the integrity of the International Settlement at Shanghai</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg873">Measures taken by the United States for the
                                    protection of American lives and property in China resulting
                                    from hostilities between Japan and China</ref>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg906">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">China</hi>
                        </ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Japan</hi>: <list>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg907">Termination by Japan of the 1911 four-power
                                    convention on fur seals in the north Pacific; Japanese proposals
                                    for new agreement</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg922">Representations to Japan over tampering with
                                    American official mail</ref>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg925">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Index</hi>
                        </ref>
                    </item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
